                "text": "Order BB-1041: shipped. Dates: placed 2026-09-23, roasted 2026-09-25, shipped 2026-09-27. Ships to CZ with Vltava Post, tracking number VP481937721CZ. Items: 1 x Ethiopia Guji, filter, 250 g, at 349 CZK each; 1 x Colombia Huila, filter, 250 g, at 319 CZK each. Delivery 89 CZK. Total 757 CZK."
              },
              {
                "id": "passage:shipping.late-parcels",
                "title": "Shipping and delivery §4: Late parcels",
                "text": "If a parcel within the Czech Republic has not arrived 5 working days after dispatch, or 10 working days for the rest of the EU, send us the order number. We open an investigation with the carrier the same day and update you within 2 working days."
              }
